  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\omega$ is an imaginary cube root of unity, then the value of the determinant $\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}1+\\omega & 0 & -\\omega \\\\ 1+\\omega^{2} & \\omega & -\\omega^{2} \\\\ \\omega+\\omega^{2} & \\omega & -\\omega^{2}\\end{array}\\right|$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ltmKf",
      "text": "$-2 \\omega$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "P1ylb",
      "text": "$-3 w^{2}$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Spwge",
      "text": "-1",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a9A4I",
      "text": "0",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}1+\\omega & \\omega^{2} & -\\omega \\\\ 1+\\omega^{2} & \\omega & -\\omega^{2} \\\\ \\omega+\\omega^{2} & \\omega & -\\omega^{2}\\end{array}\\right|$\r\n$\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}0 & \\omega^{2} & -\\omega \\\\ 0 & \\omega & -\\omega^{2} \\\\ -1+\\omega & \\omega & -\\omega^{2}\\end{array}\\right|$\r\n$=(-1+\\omega)\\left(-\\omega^{4}+\\omega^{2}\\right)=(\\omega-1)\\left(\\omega^{2}-c\\right.$\r\n$=\\omega^{3}-\\omega^{2}-\\omega^{2}+\\omega=-3 \\omega^{2}$",
    "image": null
  },
